# Backspice (left hand) by Alex Bravo — https://github.com/AlexBravo/Twiddler
# Converted from "config v5 - for Twiddler 3/twiddler.cfg" in that repository.
# Personal macros (name, email, phone) and four Alt+Shift text-selection macros were removed.
#
# Format: one chord per line, "CHORD = OUTPUT".
#   CHORD  classic notation: optional thumb keys (N A C S = T1 T2 T3 T4) then four
#          letters for finger rows 1-4 (index..pinky), each L, M, R or O (none).
#          Twiddler 4 notation also works: "T4 F1R F3M", "F0M", "T14 F2R".
#   OUTPUT literal text; special keys in angle brackets: <Space> <Enter> <Tab>
#          <Backspace> <Esc> <Up> <Cmd+s> <Ctrl+Shift+z> ...; write \< for "<" and \\ for "\".
#
# Thumb keys used here: N = Num (macOS Cmd shortcuts), S = Shift (capitalised MCCs).
